      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As a follow-up to his talk in the &lt;a href=&#34;http://fosdem.org/2007/schedule/tracks/internetservices&#34;&gt;Internet Services track&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href=&#34;http://fosdem.org/2007/schedule/events/jabber&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Secure Communications with Jabber&amp;#39;&lt;/a&gt;, this Q&amp;amp;A session with &lt;a href=&#34;http://fosdem.org/2007/schedule/speakers/peter+saint-andre&#34;&gt;Peter Saint-Andre&lt;/a&gt; provides more time for answering questions.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Also, last-minute lightning talks (5 min. each) will be scheduled in at the end of this slot.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
